# Keep the files this repo depends on byte-stable across platforms.
# The workflows are run by GitHub Actions on Linux, and streak.yml diffs its own
# SVGs to decide whether to commit — a CRLF rewrite would show up as a change.

* text=auto eol=lf

*.svg  text eol=lf
*.yml  text eol=lf
*.py   text eol=lf
*.md   text eol=lf
